\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Memoriale de modo observandi interdictum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Titel beschnitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit summa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [D]e modo obseruandi interdictum memoriale quoddam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro simplicibus colligendo et correctioni subiciendo. Sciendum quod quando universitas, populus, ciuitas, locus uel terra ecclesiastico supponitur interdicto ... - ... faciliter et plene patet, quid sit interdictum generale et speciale. Explicit summa. Incipit summula secundus d. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Eingeteilt in 50 Artikel.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck als Werk des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : De modo observandi interdictum. Magdeburg: Albert Ravenstein und Joachim Westval, 3.XII.1483, vgl. GW 1728 (nicht eingesehen), in Hss. aber auch anonym bzw. unter wechselnden Verfassernamen (Johannes Andreae, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Marcus de Spira}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Martinus de Spira}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u252 \'fcberliefert. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , GQ II, S. 223. Auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Frankfurt, Ms. Praed. 61}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Stra\u223 \'dfburg?, um 1443), 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Powitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Frankfurt II/1, S. 153.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset2 Symbol;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Distinctio de interdicto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [I]N summa vero ad breuem doctrinam predicta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  adiuuanda hec colligitur disctinctio de interdicto ... - ... quod non cogantur allegari etc. et sic est finis. Jo\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 annes\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Andree.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Interlineare und marginale Korrekturen, wohl von wenig sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Incipit, aber abweichendem Explicit auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Darmstadt, HLHB, Hs 79, Fasz. I}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15. Jh., Mitte), 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. die vorl\u228 \'e4ufige Hs.-beschreibung von U. Spyra in Manuscripta Medievalia (http://www.manuscripta-mediaevalia.de/hs/projekt-Darmstadt-pdfs/0079_mm.pdf, Stand 15.09.08)}

