\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (4, 5) (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Kommentar zur {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita Alexandri Magni}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  mit Bezug auf die f\u252 \'fcnfte Vision des Propheten Daniel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (4) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C<umque redisset Alexander in Babiloniam sumpto veneno}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... Nam quatuor ex hiis tantum, aliis abiectis regnauerunt, sicut in historia Danielis est comprehensum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vidit enim Daniel pugnam Alexandri aduersus Darium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sub metaphora arietis et hirci in hunc modum scribens: \u8218 \'82Anno tercio regis Balthazar \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vidi in uisione me esse super portam Ulai ...\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Dn 8,1-4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Per istum arietem intelligitur Darius Arsani filius, per duo cornua duo regna ipsius Medorum scilicet et Persarum. \u8218 \'82Et ecce hircus caprarum ueniebat ab occidentem ...\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Dn 8,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic est Alexander quasi uolans, per inuia queque gradiens ut quasi hircus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Hec est expositio magistri in scolastica historia. Sed angelus qui docebat Danielem de omnibus exposuit tacitis nominibus sic dicens: Ego ostendam tibi que uentura sint ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Dn 8,18-22)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Huc usque expositio angeli.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (4) \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petrus Comestor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Historia scholastica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Historia libri Esther, cap. V, vgl. Druck: PL 198, Sp. 1498-C; (5) weitgehend \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petrus Comestor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Historia scholastica, Historia libri Danielis, cap. VII, vgl. Druck: PL 198, Sp. 1455D-1456C.}

