\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola Alexandri ad Dindimum regem Bragmanorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<epe [sonst: Saepius] ad aures meas fando peruenit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... ut prebeas responsa quesitis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola Dindimi, regis Bragmanorum ad Alexandrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 esiderantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 te Alexandrem scire quid sit perfecta sapientia ... - ... magnamque cum deo habere cognitionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...], Text bricht am Seitenende ab.
