\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paulus Diaconus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola dedicatoria ad Carolum Magnum.}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [D]IVINE largitatis munere sapientia potentiaque}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prefulgido domino regi Carolo, regum sublissimo, Paulus ultimus seruulus. Cupiens aliquid vestris bibliothecis addere ... - ... vita comite ad potiora excitabat.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Editionen: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lindsay\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1913, s. o. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 1f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 mmler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hg.), MGH Epistulae IV/2, Berlin 1895, S. 508, Nr. 11. Zur Widmung der Epitome an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karl den Gro\u223 \'dfen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Manitius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Geschichte, Bd. 1, S. 264-266; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Cervani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , L\rquote epitome (s. o. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 147-157.
