\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assit principio sancta Maria meo.\plain \f2\fs24  [Prolog:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [E]x agro veteri uirtutum semina morum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  / ... \plain \f2\fs24 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [T]hobie natale solum Galilea volumptas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\fs24 [sonst: voluntas] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f2\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Explicit expletum \plain \f2\fs24 [sonst: explicitum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Thobyam qui legit / Thobyam merita religione sequi. \plain \f2\fs24 Explicit und Datierung s. o.
