\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Liudgerus Monasteriensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dirk Frankenszoon Pauw}}\plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Canonisatio sancti Swiberti}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus in canonisationem sancti Swiberti episcopi. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. [Epistola Richfridi:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<ilecto patri et confratri Lutgero}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancte Monasteriensis ecclesie episcopo Richfri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dus sancte Traiectensis ecclesie sacerdos et episcopus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 um enim penes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: apud] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nos in nostro conuentu Frisie in vico Docken ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Responsio Liudgeri:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Responsio ad predicta cum recummendacione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancti Marcellini ob curacionem leprosorum. Capitulum ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 U\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 enerabili confratri et gentilium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: gentium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 predicatori eximio Richfrido Traiectensis ecclesie episcopo Lutgerus seruus Iesu Christi ... Postulas a me dilecte pater rem quidem non difficilem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Text:] >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ut Pippinus dux castrum Werda construxerit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et meritis sancti Swiberti episcopi uictoriam contra paganorum obtinuerit. Caput tercium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gitur anno dominice incarnacionis tricesimo tercio post celebrem transitum sanctisssimi Swiberti ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in quo collocarentur sacrosancta ossa corporis ipsius sancti Swiberti episcopi. Ad laudem et gloriam ... Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abweichend vom Druck die beiden Widungsbriefe als eigenst\u228 \'e4ndige Kapitel gez\u228 \'e4hlt.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leibniz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Scriptores (s. o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Bd. II, S. 243-253; Vita (1717) (s. o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 103-152. Vgl. BHL 7942. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (ohne diese Hs.) und Verfasserfrage s. o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

