\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2) [NH 1 = Haupthand dieser Seite:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pro prima figura ,Seruat maiorem variatque secunda minorem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ; tertia maiorem variat servatque minorem\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Pro secunda figura: ,Cesare cum ferio camestres cum dariano ...\rquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reducere per impossibile syllologismos in prima figura est ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; am Ende Merkspruch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus removet ignorantiam ... - ... Epilogus commendat memorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (3) [\u252 \'fcber dem Merkspruch, 15. Jh., 2. H.:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item omnis proprius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mixte qualitatis \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex partibus contradicentibus.}

