\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<E respiracione quidem aliqui priorum phisicorum dixerunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uel propter passionem febris caloris faciliter moriuntur. Est finis de respiracione et inspiracione. 
