\pard\keep\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Einschub:] 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Joachim de Flore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Super Hieremiam prophetam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ausz\u252 \'fcge.
\par \pard\keep\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Praefatio, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >U<erba Ieremie etc. Ut intelligatur de temporibus regum Iuda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad falsorum fratrum in mago Symone signatorum. Iudicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus cap. I-L:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Signat tribus Iuda romanam ecclesiam secundum intellectum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... futuris uiris euangelicis \lquote recedere de medio Caldeorum\rquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Vergleich zum Druck stark gek\u252 \'fcrzte Exzerpte vom Anfang und Ende des Werkes. Druck: Abbatis Ioachimi ... in Ieremiam prophetam interpretatio, K\u246 \'f6ln 1577 (eingesehenes Exemplar: UBL Script. eccles. 1966/4), S. 1-384. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (jeweils ohne diese Hs.) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB III, Nr. 4039; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Reeves\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Influence of Prophecy, Nr. 3, S. 518; R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Moynihan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The development of the \u8222 \'84Pseudo-Joachim\ldblquote  commentary \u8222 \'84Super Hieremiam\ldblquote : New Manuscript Evidence, in: M\u233 \'e9langes de l'Ecole Fran\u231 \'e7aise de Rome, Moyen \u194 \'c2ge - Temps Modernes 98 (1986), S. 109-142, hier S. 111, Anm. 7. }

