\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Joachim de Flore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Enchiridion super Apocalypsim}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [Nachtrag, 15. Jh., 2. H\u228 \'e4lfte / 16. Jh., 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Enchiridion\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Enchiridion\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q<Vam propensioribus studiis a uiris catholicis et orthodoxis certatum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... magis autem ex tunc et usque in secula seculorum. Amen. Expliciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 encheridion super librum apochalipsis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: E. K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Burger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hg.), Joachim de Flore, Enchiridion super Apocalypsim, Toronto 1986 (Pontificial Institute of Medieval Studies. Studies and Texts 78), S. 9-90; A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tagliapietra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hg.), Sull'Apocalisse. Testo originale a fronte Gioacchino da Fiore, Mailand 1994, S. 128-324. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (jeweils ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  RB III, Nr. 4016, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Reeves\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Influence of Prophecy, Nr. 3, S. 513; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Burger, S. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1-6, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tagliapietra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 123-125. 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. Nicht in \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , aber in \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Br\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. o. 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Wannenmacher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. o. Lit.), S. 266, 270.}

