\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<Ost tabulam alphabeticam materiarum annotandarum vissum (!) fuit mihi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  fore utile et notabiles questiones qui in volumine hoc ... ponuntur annotare et per litteras alphabeti ponere iuxta modum prefactum (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 et primo sequuntur questiones incipientes a littera \u8218 \'82a\rquote . Utrum attencio requiratur in omni re: car. 16 col. 1 [= Druck, 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Utrum Adam et angeli ante peccatum haberent fidem ... car. 52 col. 3 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 = Druck, 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... Utrum ymagines virginis Marie et aliorum sanctorum sint venerande et qua veneracione: ibi \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 car. 147\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 col. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 = Druck, 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .}

