\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus Petrarca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De viris illustribus vitae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 19, Ausschnitt.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legati cum ad Cesarem venissent ad genua prouoluti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  verba in hanc fecere sentenciam: Parce, Cesar, parce neque propter degeneres actus nostros ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De illo solo speramus, quem offendimus.
