\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epigrammata et signa poetarum [De ratione punctandi]}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epigmata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [= epigrammata] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et signa poetarum. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Praefatio:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Salutem plurimam dicit. Amoris infaciabilibus sane fateor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Cogit igitur eiusmodi instanciam caritatis me aliquid p. v. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 pro vobis?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de racione punctandi summum opere ... enucliare ... - ... quod est ad pronunciacionis comodum ordinata. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sunt enim epigmata, id est descriptiones sive superscriptiones uel quilibet titulus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sunt eciam puncti, quibus utimur, scilicet suspensiuus, coma, colus uel colon, periodus interrogatiuus, exclamatiuus, ammiratiuus. Item suspensiuus est virgula, que posses metri gracia poni, antequam sensus clausule completus sit ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Sunt ego punctorum eorundum forme tales ... - ... magna siquid michi vobiscum est amicicia.}

