\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Daran 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Franciscus Poggius Bracciolinus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber facetiarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 , Praefatio und Kap. 100 (De sene qui portavit asinum super se)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Praefatio:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Multos denique futuros esse arbitror, qui has meas confabulaciones}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... ad hilaritatem remissionemque conuerti. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Senex quidem fuisse dicitur, qui cum adolescentulo filio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  precedente absque onere asello quem uenditurus erat, ad mercatum profiscebatur ... - ... dum omnibus parere cupit, nemini satisfaciens, asellum perdidit etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Druck: Poggii Florentini oratoris clarissimi ac secretarii apostolici Historiae Convivales Disceptativae: Orationes, Invectivae \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Faceciarum Liber, Stra\u223 \'dfburg 1511, I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und XI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (eingesehenes Exemplar: UB Leipzig, Orat. lat. rec. 4b). Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (ohne diese Hs.) vgl. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Studien zum italienischen und deutschen Humanismus, hg. von P. O. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rom 1975 (Storia e Letteratura 129), S. 10.}

