\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Legende sanctorum qui inferius suo ordine describuntur incipiunt in crastino nativitatis domini a vita beate Anastasie et terminantur ad legendam beati Moysi abbatis inclusive per errorem obmisse sunt in hoc libro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. [Text:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De ethimologia nominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<nastasia dicitur ab ana quod est sursum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ne hoc humane potencie ascri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [batur..., bricht ab.
