\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Articuli condemnati Wikelef magistri et Iohannis Luudouiis in Anglia in claustro fratrum predicatorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno 1380 a 13 episcopis a archiepiscopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cantaruensi et a 13 magistris in theologia. Primus:\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Substancia panis et vini manet post consecracionem in sacramento altaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... - \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plures sunt adhuc errores ipsius magistri Iohannis Wikelef, quos videre possumus et eius dialogo trilogo et aliis suis libris.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Edition: H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Denzinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Enchiridion symbolorum, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 37\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1991, Nr. 1151-1195.}

