\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Computus Nurembergensis cum commentario}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mnia cum inferiora motibus corporum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Kommentar:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sciendum clericus principaliter tenetur quattuor scire in ecclesia dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  - ... et difficiliora in astronomia ponita etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <; Rest von 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer; (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >O<mnia cum inferiora motibus corporum superiorum gubernantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; [Kommentar:]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste liber totalis de cuius subiecto visum est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prima sui divisione diuiditur in duos libros parciales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Ende des Texts:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ad oppositionem addideris uenit quadra secunda etc. finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Datierung s. o.; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Ende des Kommentars:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... sed vnaqueque coniunccio est sui ipsius coniunccio et non sequentis. Et sic terminatur computus Nurembergensis de quo deus gloriosus una cum gloriosa uirgine sit benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Druck: Grundtext (ohne Kommentar): Computus Norembergensis perutilis clerico cum figuris. Leipzig: Jakob Thanner, 1499 (vgl. GW 7279, eingesehenes Exemplar: Leipzig, UB, Ms 1295/7) aii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -cvi\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Dieser Prolog und Kommentar auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Uppsala, UB, C 655 (Braunsberg, Ermland, 1445-47), 60}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 -83}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Andersson-Schmitt/Hallberg/Hedlund\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Uppsala 6, S. 224f. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (jeweils ohne diese Hs.) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zinner,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Astronomische Hss., Nr. 7513-7546, dort als m\u246 \'f6glicher Verfasser Martin v. N\u252 \'fcrnberg (?) angegeben; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Klebs,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Incunabula, Nr. 296, 1-3; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thorndike\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kibre,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Sp. 989.7 und 788.5; \plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 Rosi\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u324 \'f1\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 ska,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Scientific Writings, Nr. 1511.}

