\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 HD: nachtr\u228 \'e4glich (Ende 15. Jh.?) Gebet eingeritzt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Birgitta Suecica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Orationes quindecim de passione, Nr. 14}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 erste Zeile unleserlich: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O Jesu unigenite altissimi patris, splendor et figura substantiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : memento illius\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 obnixe commendationis qua patri tuum spiritum commendasti d\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 icens\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et in nouissima hora exitus \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 mei\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 cipe\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 unter der Zeile eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reuertentem\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  meum spiritum exulem et peregri\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 num\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sus\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 cipe\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Horae Eboracenses, The Prymer or Hours of the Blesed Virgin Mary according to the Use of the Illustrious Church of York \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , London 1920 (The Publications of the Surtees Society 132), S. 79. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 74 mit Anm. 413, 82, 92 mit Anm. 545; U. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Montag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Das Werk der heiligen Birgitta von Schweden in oberdeutscher \u220 \'dcberlieferung, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1968 (MTU 18), S. 25-35, hier S. 25 zur lat. \u220 \'dcberlieferung; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 VL 1 (1978), Sp. 869.}

