\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prohemium in dyalogum reuelacionum Richalmi abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >R<Euelaciones iste facte sunt karissimo ac familiarissimo meo beate memorie abbati Richalmo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit prohemium. Incipit dyalogus reuelacionum Richalmi abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 st quidam frater bone non audeo dicere conversacionis ... - ... ut uix propter assidentes risum continuerit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt reuelaciones ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
