\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gertrudis de Helfta}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legatus divinae pietatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ausz\u252 \'fcge aus Liber I, III-V\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequuntur extracta de libro revelacionum beate Trute virginis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Approbatio:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nno domini m\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u176 \'b0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cc\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u176 \'b0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 octogesimo nono diuina exuberante gratia libellus iste sequens inicium habuit ... - ... contra quemlibet certaturum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Consolamini consolamini o peccatores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >U<Irgo quedam nomine Truta in predicacione quadam cum audisset}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ab igne inflammatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Wiederholung der Approbatio:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Approbacio libri prescripti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno domini m\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u176 \'b0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cc\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u176 \'b0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lxxxix\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u176 \'b0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  divina exuberante gratia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... contra quemlibet certaturum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hucusque excerpta de libro reuelacionum beatissime virginis Trute uix 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aut quinta pars et nec eo ordine transscripta propter defectum temporis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ausz\u252 \'fcge 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  aus Lib. I (cap. VII,3 und XI,12 etc.), 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  aus Lib. III (cap. III, VII, XVIII,9, XVIII,19-21, XIX,3 etc.), 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  aus Lib. IV (cap. II,4, II,6, II,8, II,5 etc.), 201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  aus Lib. V (cap. XV,1-2, XXII,1-3, XXIII,3, XXV,1-2 etc.). Abschnitte jeweils ohne Kennzeichnung des Buchs und Kapitels und mit eigenen \u220 \'dcberschriften versehen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Doy\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u232 \'e8\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 re, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 J.-M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Cl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ment\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , B. de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Vregille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hg.)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Gertrude d\rquote Helfta, \u338 \'8cuvres spirituelles, Bd. II-V, Paris 1968-1986 (Sources Chr\u233 \'e9tiennes 139, 143, 225, 331).}

