\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1) (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Fl\u252 \'fcchtige Notizen zum folgenden Text.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2) (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis ... In presenti actu diuino suffragante auxilio tria breuissime sum facturus. Primo elenchis sophisticis aliqua sophismata propono ... Primo disputandum est istud: Interiectio est pars orationis mentis affectum voce incognita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (sonst: incondita)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  significat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cassiodor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Institutiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. 2, cap. 1, vgl. Ed. R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mynors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Oxford 1961, S. 95) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber Meteorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Impressionibus metheorologicis: utrum potest esse sciencia ...  - ... propter colorem et non propter medium.}

