\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Incipiunt epitheta nominum et primo ad papam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deinde ad imperatorem deinde ad principes et sic deinceps. Beatus. clemens. pius. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epitheta ad amasias et puellas quascumque. Amorosa. dulcorosa. nitida. ... Epitheta ad fratres consanguineos amicis cognatos socios et equales quoscumque. Dilectus. predilectus. precipuus. \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u188 \'bc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epitheta ad minores subiectos quoscumque. Deuotus. fidelis. subiectus. ... Incipiunt epitheta nominum mala. Acerbus. atrox. auarus. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epitheta nominum indifferencia. Albus. altus. austerus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Incipiunt epitheta uerbi bona per ordinem alphabeti. Affectanter. affectuose. amirabiliter ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Incipiunt epitheta uerbi mala. Auare. cupide. crudeliter. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... stricte. totaliter. uiride. Et item \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de epithetis etc. 
