\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Speculum disculorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<Colaris dixit socii: nos sumus correctus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... librosque magnos legere quos et pronunciare. Explicit dictamen magistri Nicolay Sehusen rectoris scolarium {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezsoz[0].4600/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ecclesie beate Marie virginis Erffurdensis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod composuit. 
