\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex primo libro metaphisice Aristotelis. \plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Kommentar:\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota totus liber metaphisice considerat de entibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uniuersaliter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum quod encia sunt ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text:\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnes homines natura scire desiderant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Commentator circa 12. librum: Universalia secundum Aristotelem sunt collecta a particularibus ab intellectu ... - ... Si esset aliqua intelligentia non mouens, illa esset ociosa. Ista de libris metaphisice sufficiant. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rest der Seite leer.
