\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex primo yconomicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Kommentar:\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste liber [interlinear eingef\u252 \'fcgt: totaliter] existens secundus in ordine librorum naturalis philosophie Aristotelis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text:\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iconomica et politica differunt primo sicut domus et ciuitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... Yconomus debet habere considerationem ad dominum ... secundum exigenciam sui status. Ista ex librum yconomicorum Aristotelis sufficiant. Deo gracias.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Edition des Grundtextes: Aristoteles Latinus 30.1-3 (in Vorbereitung, vgl. AL-Database). Vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Lacombe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Aristoteles latinus, Bd.1, S. 166f. \u196 \'c4hnliches Incipit und Explicit auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Freiburg, UB, Ms. 114 (1491-93), 25}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 -50}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. Christoph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Fl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 eler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rezeption und Interpretation der Aristotelischen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Politica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  im sp\u228 \'e4ten Mittelalter, 2 B\u228 \'e4nde, Amsterdam/Philadelphia 1992 (Bochumer Studien zur Philosophie 19.1-2), Bd. 2, Nr. 95, S. 63f.}

