\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur epistola beati Bernardi ad Raymundum nepotem suum de cura domestica siue modo gubernandi rem familiarem. \plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Gru\u223 \'dfformel:\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gracioso et felici militi Raymundo domino}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  castri sancti Ambrosii Bernhardus in senium deductus salutem. \plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text:\plain \f3\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Doceri petisti a nobis de cura et modo rei familiaris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... ad quod eam perducat sua dampnabilis senectus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Rest der Seite leer.
