\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De corpore Christi quid fiat post sumptum. Sequitur de corpore Christi postquam sumptum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Respondemus quod ipsum corpus quod sumptum est et comestum in altare integrum manet in celo ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... ac refectos nos ad uitam perducat eternam. Amen. Explicit tractatus de sacramento altaris Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Eintrag des Amplonius, s. o. Geschichte.
