gentibus\rquote : 29 hic est pulcra valde et terrifica exhortacio ad religi\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 osos\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . / In obitu fratris \u8218 \'82Migrauit a seculo uiuit in Christo\rquote : 40, 50, 112 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 / \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 nachtr\u228 \'e4glich vom Schreiber eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notabile est:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82Ducam eam in solitudinem et ibi loquar ad cor eius\rquote : 42, 51 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . / \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 / Susceptio cuiusdam episcopi: 44\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . / De signis electorum: 54 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 71\plain \f1\super\la