\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 35 kurze, von 1 bis 18 Zeilen reichende Exzerpte zu Themen des monastischen Lebens (schola Christi, superbia, concordia fratrum etc.). Im Folgenden werden nur die Incipits vom Anfang und Ende angegeben. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius in pastorali suo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Regula pastoralis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Talis sit electio, ut nullum moneat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nicht nachgewiesen); (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus de scola Christi, qui est ecclesia: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Haec est schola ad quam paruuli ducuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Quodvultdeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De accedentibus ad gratiam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , cap. 1, CCSL 60, S. 443); (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De patria. Augustinus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Excelsa est patria, humilis uia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In Iohannis evangelium tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , tract. 28, pars 5, CCSL 36, S. 279)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (33) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Plaga uita praesens. Dicitur super psalmum 122: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In hac uita uapulamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  (Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Enarrationes in psalmos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ps. 122, pars 6, CCSL 40, S. 1819); (34)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plenitudo. Super psalmum 72: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum autem uenerit plenitudo temporis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  (Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ibidem, Ps. 72, pars 16, CCSL 39, S. 995); (35)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 am Anfang unleserlich\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 idem dicit super psalmum 10:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eadem scriptura autem intelligitur: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 fecundat pectora piorum atque fidelium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ibidem, Ps. 10, Pars 10, CCSL 38, S. 81).}

