\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Indagine}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de absolutione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini nostri Iesu Christi. Incipit tractatus absolucionis a sententia excommunicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et aliis censuris siue ab homine siue a iure latis et ab omnibus peccatis in articulo mortis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >T<Ibi dabo ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Mt 16,19).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Hec sunt verba Christi ad Petrum dicta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut habentur Math. XVI. Et per hec verba in persona Petri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dedit Christus ecclesie sue claues \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [drei Formulae absolvendi mit Handlungsanweisungen f\u252 \'fcr den Priester:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma absolucionis in articulo mortis dicenda super infirmum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Misereatur tui ... Dominus noster Iesus Christus per piissimam misericordiam et sanctissimam passionem ... et ego auctoritate ipsius absoluo te a uinculis excommunicacionis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item alia forma absolucionis in articulo mortis. Misereatur tui ... Dominus noster Iesus Christus per meritum sacratissime sue passionis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item alia forma absolucionis et brevior. Misereatur tui etc. Dominus noster Iesus Christus propter suam bonitatem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut ea possideant in secula seculorum prestante domino nostro Iesu Christe qui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de modo absolvendi in articulo mortis et de modo sepeliendi defunctos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Kolophon s. o.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Klapper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, S. 21, D. 20, Nr. 2-4. Die erste Formula absolutionis \u228 \'e4hnlich in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aachen, StB, Cod. Wings 6 (Breviarium Carthusianum aus der Kartause Trier, 1478), 301}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mentzel-Reuters\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Aachen \u214 \'d6B II, S. 35. Auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Halle, ULB, Qu. Cod. 134, 113r-124}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s. o. Geschichte. Ein \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de absolucione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  wird im Werkverzeichnis (um 1468) genannt, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Klapper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, S. 130, Bl. 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

