\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini nostri ... Incipit tractatus de transitu de unius religionis obseruancia ad aliam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Neque deserentes collectionem nostram ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Hbr 10,25]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Et dicit glossa ibidem: sicut quidam timore persecucionem cedunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... - ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs24 compo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pocius angelum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magni consilii in omnibus attendat et sequatur qui est deus benedictus in secula Amen.
