\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Daran: 17zeiliger Nachtrag des Johannes de Indagine (s. o. Geschichte): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item Carthusienses non benedicant populum in fine misse quia non habent populum subiectum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Schlu\u223 \'df unleserlich:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 autem episcopo benedicat. Sollempniter xxvii valeto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  curs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ualde scriptum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ ...?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ministrare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

