\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini ... Incipit exposicio super tercio precepto scilicet de sabbato sanctificatione. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Memento ut diem sabbati ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ex 20,8-11).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Hec sunt uerba domini dei que locutus est ad filios}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... in nomine domini imponamus. Amen. Et de sabbato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pectoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad sabbatum eternitatis transeamus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am unteren Rand beschnitten]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Explicit s. o.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Klapper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, S. 21, D 20, Nr. 13; MBK II, 320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8222 \'84De sanctificatione sabbati et qualiter festa sint tenenda\rdblquote .}

