 \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Carrlostadius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Andreas Rudolf Bodenstein}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von Karlstadt, \u8224 \'86 1541\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Hau\u223 \'dfschonn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Hussgen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Hausschein, gr\u228 \'e4zisiert Oecolampadius, \u8224 \'861531\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Burger, Osiander \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Andreas Osiander}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8224 \'86 1552\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capito \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Wolfgang K\u246 \'f6pfel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lat. Capito, \u8224 \'86 1541\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et id genus diabolicum, falsi predicatores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Sicut Zwinglius et Occolampadius dixerunt, quod corpus Christi non sit vere in sacramento ...
