\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1) (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Notizen philosophischen Inhalts: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Notandum est quod homo nomen }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (?)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  philosophia est inuentum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... philosophi uocabantur sapientes ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , am li. Rand (querst\u228 \'e4ndig) Federproben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine deus noster, quam admirabile est ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ps 8,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnia dat dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 
