\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur Tractatus optimus in seruicio dei proficere volentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < [darunter von Bibliothekarshand eingef\u252 \'fcgt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domini Boneventure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ordinis minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 am re. Rand eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 formula vite comp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [endio]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]; \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Praefatio:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<I vis in spiritu proficere et hoc esse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propter quod ut hoc fieres ad scolam virtutum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... nec vllam ei reuerenciam exhiberi. >Explicit formula vite compendiosa< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [daneben eingef\u252 \'fcgt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domini Boneventure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)].
