\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Meditaciones circa cerimonialia misse pro devocione excitanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Prolog:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<xigis a me frater dulcis in domino, ut circa canonem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  misse aliquas tibi meditaciones compendiosas depingam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tractatus de preparacione misse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<nte omnia scire volo tuam caritatem quod si lingwis loquerer angelorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Sic enim dicit hiis, qui a dextris sunt: venite benedicti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 25,34)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad quod nos perducat qui sine fine vivit et regnat ... Amen. >Et sic est finis illius tractatus de preparacione misse<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
