\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus libri de amicicia christiana et dilectione dei et proximi Petri Blesensis archidiaconi Londeniensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Prolog:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Q<uoniam diminute sunt veritates}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Text\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Incipit de caritate seu dilectione dei et proximi Cassiodori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<micicia vera non est nisi suum in deo habeat fundamentum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... eterna et consumata glorie plenitudo. Amen. Deo gracias. Explicit ... 
