\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus duarum questionum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur utrum habens a proprio sacerdote licenciam confitendi possit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  confiteri alicui non habenti exercicium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Secundo dubitatur an sacerdos comittens fornicacionem cum soluta incidat in simplicem fornicacionem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... talis consuetudo dat ius absolvendi et non est reprobata.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Laut Nachtrag im Inh.verz. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Werk des Johannes de Indagine.}

