\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Silvestris?}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Formula honestae vitae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit opus discipline fratris Bertoldi fformula honeste viuendi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit opus discipline fratris Bertoldi fformula honeste viuendi et incipitur sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<etis a me frater karissime quod numquam et nusquam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a suo prouisore aliquem audiui petiisse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... quia profectus tuus gaudium meum est et gloria mea in domino. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Marginalglossen der Vorlage kopiert.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: PL 184, Sp. 1167-1170C. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bloomfield}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , Incipits, Nr. 3897}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zur Verfasserfrage der \u8222 \'84Formula honestae vitae\ldblquote  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus Silvestris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ?) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glorieux,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Pour rev. Migne, S. 73; B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Haur\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 au\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Notices et extraits de quelques manuscrits latins de la Biblioth\u232 \'e8que Nationale, Bd. 2, Paris 1891, S. 344-346. }

