\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Textbeginn: Nr. 1-7\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum de xii articulis fidei et de xii lapidibus preciosis ipsis comperatis. Duodecim articuli fidei in symbolo xii apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Wort unleserlich\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et significari possunt per duodecim gemmas ... \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Jaspis qui prebet securitatem et expellit timorem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Hunc lapidem ponit beatus Petrus dicens: Credo in deum patrem. ... - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Crisolicus qui micante habet colorem ... Hunc lapidem ponit beatus Philippus dicens: Inde venturus est iudicare uiuos et mortuus. Sequitur. Berillus in precedenti folio require. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Fortsetzung: Nr. 8-12\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Berillus qui oculot \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 f\u252 \'fcr oculos, so auch auf 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  marginal\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  clarificat et amorem coniugalem coronat \u8230 \'85 Hunc lapidem ponit beatus Bartholomeus dicens: Credo in spiritum sanctum. ... - ... \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 12.\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ametistus qui ab amore dicitur et violacius colore mixtus micat ut rosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hunc lapidem ponit Mathyas dicens: Et vitam eternam amen. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Schlu\u223 \'dfbemerkung:\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hii sunt lapides preciosi qui in corona iusti et electi ... in gloria in futuro quam nobis prestare dignetur ....}

