\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota Questiones de fide catholica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Q<Vueritur vtrum ex scripturis receptis a iudeis possit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  efficaciter probari saluatorem nostrum fuisse deum et hominem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... semper habet fidelitatem adiunctam. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig oder Schlu\u223 \'df abweichend, vgl. darunter Notiz des Schreibers (17. Jh.): \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 una aut altera plagula huius manuscripti deest\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
