s proprie, scilicet motu et sensu.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (De Anima 403b24-26)\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Explicit commentum super prohemium de anima.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [Textbeginn] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 [Q]Uidam a[utem?] dicunt eorum, quod illud, quod est proprie prius anime}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...}

